## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
After each phase:
1. Navigate to the new pages and verify they render correctly
2. Submit forms and verify data is saved to the database
3. Verify role-based access restrictions work
4. Hard refresh browser to clear CSS/JS cache

### Functional Tests
- Register a new clinical case → open detail view → fill MLEF → add wounds → request investigation → add referral → upload photo → update MLR status → verify all data persists
- Register a new autopsy case → open detail view → fill cause of death → add wounds → update PMR status → verify all data persists
- Test "My Cases" filter with different doctor logins
- Verify MLEF register and PM register show searchable data
